<body>
    <h1>03 Use Case 3 - Delete Address Data</h1>
    <div class=3D"Section1">
        <h1 local-id=3D"3c5bccc5d511" id=3D"id-03UseCase3-DeleteAddressData=
-Goal"><strong>Goal</strong></h1>
<p local-id=3D"a0447d3861b2">As a user, I want to permanently delete a part=
ner's existing address to remove incorrect, <span class=3D"inline-comment-m=
arker" data-ref=3D"1877dd65-9d6f-4cda-8fbb-fdc5d0d9a941">outdated, or no lo=
nger needed addresses</span> from the system.</p>
<h1 local-id=3D"c76be542caa0" id=3D"id-03UseCase3-DeleteAddressData-Actors"=
><strong>Actors</strong></h1>
<p local-id=3D"5e2399ca91fe">Any user with access to the Partner Module and=
 write permission to partner data can delete partner addresses.</p>
<h1 local-id=3D"0a4e47765011" id=3D"id-03UseCase3-DeleteAddressData-MainFlo=
w"><strong>Main Flow</strong></h1>
<ol start=3D"1" local-id=3D"e0048ed9-fa5e-4216-9b95-cbdf8557f34a">
<li local-id=3D"d05a37f9-7875-4cda-af93-3b2f574d882f">
<p local-id=3D"e46b459aa96c">The user navigates to the partner module and o=
pens the <strong>Address Data</strong> section.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"bbb6563a-6995-497c-9221-9c2bec3dcfc5">
<p local-id=3D"a2ccdce43186">The user clicks the <strong>Delete</strong> ac=
tion in the burger menu.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"ad0d5011-984d-4589-a99b-c096add595e9">
<p local-id=3D"723f5ca3d631">The user confirms the deletion in the pop=E2=
=80=91up dialogue.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"810c2ba2-aa19-4167-b05c-7187d78a9222">
<p local-id=3D"980b04c0da15">The system permanently deletes the address and=
 removes it from the overview.</p></li>
</ol>
<h1 local-id=3D"2e8d64dfb138" id=3D"id-03UseCase3-DeleteAddressData-Alterna=
tiveFlowsand/orExceptions"><strong>Alternative Flows and/or Exceptions</str=
ong></h1>
<h3 local-id=3D"8aba0645a60a" id=3D"id-03UseCase3-DeleteAddressData-Usercan=
celsthedeletion"><strong>User cancels the deletion</strong></h3>
<ul local-id=3D"ee230f4a-98da-4b30-8f73-6528d15a018c">
<li local-id=3D"8df1fc40-ed8c-4d82-bc83-6aa259dbcca5">
<p local-id=3D"db60ba500f34">The user presses <strong>Cancel</strong> in th=
e pop=E2=80=91up.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"eb7b39af-fd98-4f4e-828a-f6cc201c13af">
<p local-id=3D"2b80afe71278">The address remains unchanged.</p></li>
</ul>
<h3 local-id=3D"59881f4627e3" id=3D"id-03UseCase3-DeleteAddressData-Address=
deletedbyanotheruser"><strong>Address deleted by another user</strong></h3>
<ul local-id=3D"52156f36-4ed5-43ac-947d-628de49cf410">
<li local-id=3D"37080f00-a50e-4d6e-a143-9cea9ad7620f">
<p local-id=3D"f5b5d26a9e40">The user attempts to delete an address that an=
other user has already deleted.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"ec26e2cb-8c2f-4ed8-9fe5-2115f1865cd5">
<p local-id=3D"4cd1b3ba68b9">The system refreshes the view, and the address=
 is no longer visible.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"0fc791df-a6d3-475b-8aa1-6df47cf906f3">
<p local-id=3D"cd5339e2790f">No deletion operation takes place.</p></li>
</ul>
<h3 local-id=3D"ac13aff368ee" id=3D"id-03UseCase3-DeleteAddressData-Usertri=
estodeleteadefaultaddress"><strong>User tries to delete a default address</=
strong></h3>
<ul local-id=3D"7ce66198-2e41-4c1b-88fd-07b936bd49cd">
<li local-id=3D"008ba2fc-e104-4a6d-a1f4-39aa4e3ddce9">
<p local-id=3D"e5296638dd3e">The user attempts to delete a default address.=
</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"7f770f4d25e4">
<p local-id=3D"1791b65e2c6b">The system alerts the user that they are about=
 to delete the default address.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"2fbaba644e22">
<p local-id=3D"ddde1cbd7f1b">If other addresses exist, the user must set on=
e of them as the default before deletion. Otherwise, the user must confirm =
the deletion.</p></li>
</ul>
<h1 local-id=3D"77e6c02f95bb" id=3D"id-03UseCase3-DeleteAddressData-Precond=
itions"><strong>Preconditions</strong></h1>
<ul local-id=3D"a1314d44-fd8f-46e1-9a06-acb44cc46ca9">
<li local-id=3D"4258f595-5484-4155-b550-efb249931d52">
<p local-id=3D"fe723c9d771a">The user has write access to the partner=E2=80=
=99s address data.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"3bb2aa47-5015-44ff-8d0c-cfcb32d67d4e">
<p local-id=3D"088735690978"><span class=3D"inline-comment-marker" data-ref=
=3D"d33c285a-60bd-4525-9c65-6d4af0c02bb3">At least one address exists</span=
> in the <strong>Address Data</strong> section.</p></li>
</ul>
<h1 local-id=3D"e2a420aad68a" id=3D"id-03UseCase3-DeleteAddressData-Postcon=
ditions"><strong>Postconditions</strong></h1>
<ul local-id=3D"84218cc1-5853-4ebd-aea5-80139d8d0461">
<li local-id=3D"7b6af19b70cd">
<p local-id=3D"04da80501f19">If the deletion is confirmed, the address is r=
emoved and is no longer visible in the Address Data section.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"e2efc551-02f5-4834-8e00-090eec418a51">
<p local-id=3D"73d0ccd4db70">If the deletion process is cancelled or not co=
nfirmed, no changes are applied.</p></li>
</ul>
<hr local-id=3D"4919f98d-301a-47da-b599-20637f97c748">
<h1 local-id=3D"5afcc5b2759d" id=3D"id-03UseCase3-DeleteAddressData-Non-fun=
ctionalCross=E2=80=91ModuleAcceptanceCriteria"><strong>Non-functional Cross=
=E2=80=91Module Acceptance Criteria</strong></h1>
<p local-id=3D"0c7eff52371d"><em>(These are global criteria and always appl=
y.)</em></p>
<h3 local-id=3D"d29b50ed89c1" id=3D"id-03UseCase3-DeleteAddressData-=F0=9F=
=94=92Authentication">=F0=9F=94=92 <strong>Authentication</strong></h3>
<ul local-id=3D"b6a48909-0845-407f-bdc2-84cabb4c703f">
<li local-id=3D"b06f223a-090d-4e7d-a701-ea6859627c5e">
<p local-id=3D"a5cbdff05f1a">Access to protected functions is only possible=
 for authenticated users.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"660daf1d-ff7b-4710-8a89-00adb0c78bf8">
<p local-id=3D"45db6a478d47">If authentication is missing, the user is auto=
matically redirected to the login page.</p></li>
</ul>
<h3 local-id=3D"c3401d1717e9" id=3D"id-03UseCase3-DeleteAddressData-=F0=9F=
=95=92SessionManagement">=F0=9F=95=92 <strong>Session Management</strong></=
h3>
<ul local-id=3D"8f1924d2-642b-4819-90d8-8241b8e46c38">
<li local-id=3D"cfbca71f-ea12-488d-8071-278e31a7c4eb">
<p local-id=3D"bf96cb2e770d">Sessions expire after X minutes of inactivity =
(e.g., 15 minutes).</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"84beb170-f2eb-4b3e-a3ad-941a98da21cc">
<p local-id=3D"10c4e05f1b71">When the session expires, the user is automati=
cally logged out.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"8c7dc5a4-7455-45ec-ba97-8a5b18f89e90">
<p local-id=3D"312b55601591">Active sessions are extended by user interacti=
on.</p></li>
</ul>
<h3 local-id=3D"06f0d49ea48a" id=3D"id-03UseCase3-DeleteAddressData-=F0=9F=
=A7=BEVersioning/AuditTrail">=F0=9F=A7=BE <strong>Versioning / Audit Trail<=
/strong></h3>
<ul local-id=3D"fc53007e-570d-431d-9adf-b6a056fcd30a">
<li local-id=3D"4dd5fdb5-0f01-4774-a735-90940f882c48">
<p local-id=3D"4607e72e748d">Changes to relevant data (e.g., partner data, =
master data) are stored with versioning.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"921b7ba1-3496-41db-aec5-a9164d78e881">
<p local-id=3D"947c7153cb2e">Each change contains a timestamp, user ID, and=
=E2=80=94if needed=E2=80=94a reason for the change.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"77d74314-b683-4583-8640-162e68bf5370">
<p local-id=3D"829239e81c68">Versioned data is readable and traceable.</p><=
/li>
</ul>
<h3 local-id=3D"b0aa8942ac30" id=3D"id-03UseCase3-DeleteAddressData-=F0=9F=
=A7=A0Logging">=F0=9F=A7=A0 <strong>Logging</strong></h3>
<ul local-id=3D"216bba3a-aef5-40b5-8b77-3d4a4cc10890">
<li local-id=3D"76b63c45-50f6-4119-ab3f-c885f57a403a">
<p local-id=3D"a0497abc352b">All security=E2=80=91relevant actions (login, =
data changes, errors) are logged.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"1f4d85b7-7882-45d3-a2e5-4af60104fb15">
<p local-id=3D"b586e4728689">Logs include timestamp, user ID, and affected =
functionality.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"e63ddbb6-e52a-4997-93e6-a4e4f62e89d2">
<p local-id=3D"daf6d47924a0">Logs are revision=E2=80=91safe and GDPR=E2=80=
=91compliant.</p></li>
</ul>
<h3 local-id=3D"132f2eda436f" id=3D"id-03UseCase3-DeleteAddressData-=E2=9A=
=A0=EF=B8=8FFaultTolerance">=E2=9A=A0=EF=B8=8F <strong>Fault Tolerance</str=
ong></h3>
<ul local-id=3D"6550aa0a-9dd3-4416-a853-a0d5d14f0d19">
<li local-id=3D"ecdab985-1e86-4ecf-b30c-9c83000570e3">
<p local-id=3D"6a0d4833006c">The system detects and handles technical error=
s (e.g., API failures, validation issues) gracefully.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"2e0e00d4-0eeb-4024-bc20-99cd57ab93b7">
<p local-id=3D"52a1e5ea3937">Error messages are user=E2=80=91friendly and c=
ontain no technical details.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"ab690e58-3bba-43b1-bb5e-94c9795f9e74">
<p local-id=3D"6071988acbc5">Critical errors trigger logging and potentiall=
y automated notifications.</p></li>
</ul>
<h3 local-id=3D"77c011edea5b" id=3D"id-03UseCase3-DeleteAddressData-=F0=9F=
=9A=80Performance">=F0=9F=9A=80 <strong>Performance</strong></h3>
<ul local-id=3D"c914d2d2-d3c9-4d7c-a9c7-6b3f3433ebd0">
<li local-id=3D"aea41a76-eff1-4ca1-8c61-081c2487972f">
<p local-id=3D"a6cabe867d91">Response times for user actions remain under X=
 seconds (e.g., &lt; 2s for saving/deleting).</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"2bbd7e47-dae4-4529-aff4-93503bd358a4">
<p local-id=3D"09b1dc052f01">Loading times for screens and list views are o=
ptimised.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"e1234938-0fe2-43e1-86b5-3b10f6fe7846">
<p local-id=3D"f833b762ff56">The system stays stable under high load.</p></=
li>
</ul>
<hr local-id=3D"c9703c17-f1da-4fbf-b1a0-c3a91605ae4e">
<h1 local-id=3D"3fe403df0077" id=3D"id-03UseCase3-DeleteAddressData-Definit=
ionofDone"><strong>Definition of Done</strong></h1>
<ul local-id=3D"cfa9fdbe-127f-413c-ad89-dde0af56b339">
<li local-id=3D"31142e48-56b2-49fe-8780-07ef70322228">
<p local-id=3D"cb3f906ea379">All acceptance criteria are implemented in <st=
rong>Gherkin format</strong></p></li>
<li local-id=3D"ea8e1fa8-2bd7-4156-b302-f76a25412e32">
<p local-id=3D"18a8cad22254"><span class=3D"inline-comment-marker" data-ref=
=3D"20db6fec-e737-4bc3-940c-09225ffff343">Validations work correctly</span>=
</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"8038d15b-65dd-43e4-b8f3-ce9e6c3c3d51">
<p local-id=3D"4279bf4d29c7">The Delete action is available in the burger m=
enu of each address.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"aea250e4d990">
<p local-id=3D"f6443bdc4207">An address with a valid=E2=80=91from date in t=
he past is soft deleted.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"748c7e55c123">
<p local-id=3D"a41ade5b06db">A default address can be deleted only after an=
other address is set as the default, when available.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"f6a9a8ff76ef">
<p local-id=3D"717c66b7f234">When only one address exists, it can be delete=
d after confirmation.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"2ea25ffc1054">
<p local-id=3D"315f5756a5f8">If the user cancels the delete action, the add=
ress remains unchanged.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"676d0f9a2812">
<p local-id=3D"40bf61e88506">The Address Data section reflects the updated =
state immediately after deletion or cancellation.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"6192bfc1-5d40-4ce9-8a1a-b14c34b59b44">
<p local-id=3D"20f9e1134186">Unit and integration tests are implemented</p>=
</li>
<li local-id=3D"cf95bbc1-c052-4a2b-a3e5-9f07a17170b8">
<p local-id=3D"ca8a69126a1e">Documentation in Confluence is updated</p></li=
>
</ul>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
------=_Part_14_283542205.1778666502288--
